6530:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *          8 global interrupts are generated for the whole HRTIM:
6531:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - System fault and Fault 1 to 5 (regardless of the timing unit attribution)
